RULE_VERSION: 1.1
RULE_NAME: TIME_TRACKER
APP_TYPE: PRODUCTIVITY
TARGET: PI_SOLOHOST
GOAL: A reliable personal time tracker with correct elapsed time after restart.

PHASES:
- Timer creation and controls
- Correct elapsed-time calculation
- Daily summary
- Persistent storage
- Recovery after restart
- SoloHost runtime verification

REQUIRED CAPABILITIES:
- Start timer
- Stop timer
- Daily summary
- Persistent storage
- Correct elapsed time
- Restart recovery
- SoloHost runtime compatibility

FUNCTIONAL ACCEPTANCE:
- Starting a timer records a real start timestamp
- Stopping a timer records elapsed time correctly
- Daily summary reflects stored sessions
- Timer state survives restart when active state must persist
- Elapsed time is calculated from timestamps, not only in-memory counters
- Container starts and HTTP health succeeds

STOP CONDITIONS:
- Persistence behavior cannot be verified
- Timer accuracy cannot be demonstrated

MAX_CYCLES: 4
AUTO_REPAIR: true
